- You don't like it?

1318
00:45:12,683 --> 00:45:13,853
Millet Yu Jae Seok.

1319
00:45:14,513 --> 00:45:15,623
You don't like millets?

1320
00:45:15,623 --> 00:45:17,123
- No, I like it.
- Millet Jae Seok!

1321
00:45:17,123 --> 00:45:19,393
