1371
00:47:04,223 --> 00:47:05,833
- Right!
- We were just excited.

1372
00:47:05,833 --> 00:47:09,033
I run a hair salon in Japan...

1373
00:47:09,033 --> 00:47:10,663
as Crazy Karaya.

1374
00:47:10,663 --> 00:47:13,773
