1382
00:47:28,823 --> 00:47:30,023
- You're 42?
- What?

1383
00:47:30,353 --> 00:47:31,453
How long have you been doing this?

1384
00:47:32,723 --> 00:47:34,953
- 22 years.
- What? 22 years?

1385
00:47:35,223 --> 00:47:36,423
- 22 years?
- What?

1386
00:47:36,423 --> 00:47:37,623
He's been doing this for 22 years!

1387
00:47:37,923 --> 00:47:40,063
Why are you all reacting in Japanese?

1388
00:47:40,063 --> 00:47:41,193
(What?)

1389
00:47:42,033 --> 00:47:43,303
We're helping him feel at home.

1390
00:47:43,633 --> 00:47:45,233
Haven't you seen any Japanese shows?

1391
00:47:45,533 --> 00:47:46,633
Come on!

1392
00:47:46,833 --> 00:47:47,973
(Exclaiming)

1393
00:47:48,333 --> 00:47:49,403
This is basic!

1394
00:47:50,143 --> 00:47:51,973
