- then place it on the hair.

1401
00:48:09,223 --> 00:48:10,493
With your hand?

1402
00:48:10,993 --> 00:48:13,293
The dye on your hand?

1403
00:48:14,133 --> 00:48:17,203
Hello, I'm Crazy Karaya!

1404
00:48:17,763 --> 00:48:20,773
I currently run a hair salon...

1405
00:48:20,773 --> 00:48:23,903
in Osaka, Umeda.

1406
00:48:24,343 --> 00:48:28,743
I'm quite good with colorful and flamboyant hair dyes.

1407
00:48:29,383 --> 00:48:32,813
