1419
00:49:03,613 --> 00:49:05,613
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

1420
00:49:05,613 --> 00:49:07,183
Hello, nice to meet you.

1421
00:49:07,513 --> 00:49:08,813
Are you Japanese too?

1422
00:49:08,813 --> 00:49:10,923
- Are you Japanese?
- No, he's Korean.

1423
00:49:12,423 --> 00:49:14,493
Why'd you reply in Japanese, then?

1424
00:49:14,493 --> 00:49:15,523
(Feeling tricked)

1425
00:49:15,523 --> 00:49:17,123
What a prankster!

1426
00:49:17,123 --> 00:49:18,393
