1435
00:49:37,613 --> 00:49:39,653
I think the model would be nervous too.

1436
00:49:41,353 --> 00:49:42,483
Really?

1437
00:49:42,483 --> 00:49:43,583
Are you okay, sir?

1438
00:49:43,583 --> 00:49:46,453
