1440
00:49:49,123 --> 00:49:51,063
Osaka is well-known...

1441
00:49:51,063 --> 00:49:52,533
- for its comedians.
- That's right.

1442
00:49:52,533 --> 00:49:54,293
But he just might be a fun person.

1443
00:49:54,293 --> 00:49:55,463
(BIBI thinks he might be a comedian from Osaka.)

1444
00:49:55,733 --> 00:49:57,503
Okay.

1445
00:49:57,503 --> 00:49:58,633
- Okay.
- Good.

1446
00:49:58,633 --> 00:50:01,433
(He got ready to start in the meantime.)

1447
00:50:01,503 --> 00:50:04,303
- No way.
- How does that even work?

1448
00:50:04,943 --> 00:50:07,013
- Are you good?
- Yes.

1449
00:50:07,313 --> 00:50:08,773
- Is he just stamping?
- I think so.

1450
00:50:10,243 --> 00:50:13,013
(Nervous for some reason)

1451
00:50:14,553 --> 00:50:19,853
(He stamps his hand after painting dye on it?)

1452
00:50:20,293 --> 00:50:21,593
Oh, so it's a handprint!

1453
00:50:26,193 --> 00:50:28,563
