- Wilson!

1457
00:50:33,403 --> 00:50:34,503
- You're right.
- Yes.

1458
00:50:34,833 --> 00:50:37,843
- It does look pretty.
- But what about...

1459
00:50:39,573 --> 00:50:40,673
I use a brush to...

1460
00:50:40,673 --> 00:50:45,043
