1461
00:50:45,043 --> 00:50:46,113
(In awe)

1462
00:50:46,113 --> 00:50:47,483
The handprint is unique.

1463
00:50:48,713 --> 00:50:50,623
- It's pretty!
- How nice.

1464
00:50:50,623 --> 00:50:52,083
