1472
00:51:15,043 --> 00:51:17,583
(The handprint dye is finished after shampooing.)

1473
00:51:17,713 --> 00:51:21,113
So the handprint is dyed onto your hair.

1474
00:51:21,353 --> 00:51:22,723
What about feet?

1475
00:51:22,723 --> 00:51:24,223
It kind of looks like someone hit you.

1476
00:51:25,693 --> 00:51:27,923
