1483
00:51:40,373 --> 00:51:42,503
Forget that, I think he's ripping people off.

1484
00:51:44,473 --> 00:51:46,313
I don't think you should interpret that.

1485
00:51:46,573 --> 00:51:48,473
Please don't.

1486
00:51:48,613 --> 00:51:49,943
Please, don't do it.

1487
00:51:50,943 --> 00:51:53,383
