1488
00:51:54,213 --> 00:51:57,053
The handprint dye with the bleaching and dyeing beforehand...

1489
00:51:57,053 --> 00:51:59,393
is around 220 dollars.

1490
00:51:59,623 --> 00:52:00,923
Really?

1491
00:52:00,923 --> 00:52:02,423
- 220 dollars.
- It's 220 dollars.

1492
00:52:02,623 --> 00:52:04,463
- 220 dollars?
- He bleaches too.

1493
00:52:04,463 --> 00:52:05,993
- I see.
- Including that. Okay.

1494
00:52:06,763 --> 00:52:08,393
