1498
00:52:15,273 --> 00:52:16,643
It's called face shampoo.

1499
00:52:16,643 --> 00:52:18,043
- Face shampoo?
- Face shampoo.

1500
00:52:19,643 --> 00:52:21,413
- Face shampoo?
- Face shampoo?

1501
00:52:21,413 --> 00:52:22,583
