1502
00:52:22,583 --> 00:52:25,013
No, a face shampoo.

1503
00:52:25,013 --> 00:52:26,953
So he washes your face?

1504
00:52:27,453 --> 00:52:29,783
Remember, bubbles were part of our clue.

1505
00:52:30,053 --> 00:52:32,383
- That's right!
- Yes!

1506
00:52:32,383 --> 00:52:33,453
I remember.

1507
00:52:34,353 --> 00:52:38,663
