1511
00:52:44,103 --> 00:52:45,633
A face massage. I'm curious.

1512
00:52:46,903 --> 00:52:49,303
Does anyone want to try?

1513
00:52:49,303 --> 00:52:51,373
Would it wash off our makeup?

1514
00:52:51,743 --> 00:52:54,413
