- Right?

1527
00:53:20,373 --> 00:53:22,543
- How does this work?
- But he's really skilled...

1528
00:53:22,543 --> 00:53:23,803
with the preparation.

1529
00:53:25,843 --> 00:53:27,643
Okay.

1530
00:53:27,643 --> 00:53:28,643
- Okay.
- Good.

1531
00:53:28,643 --> 00:53:30,583
