(A guest who was urgently cast at 10pm last night)

2038
01:11:05,916 --> 01:11:07,156
(That urgently?)

2039
01:11:07,586 --> 01:11:09,756
(Between Ye Na and Jun Ha, who's the one urgently cast?)

2040
01:11:09,986 --> 01:11:12,396
(I got a call that felt like something was wrong.)

2041
01:11:12,626 --> 01:11:14,196
(We're thankful that he came.)

2042
01:11:14,566 --> 01:11:18,066
(Jun Ha reunites with nostalgic MCs about 21 years after "Truth Game.")

2043
01:11:18,636 --> 01:11:19,936
(Getting emotional)

2044
01:11:20,336 --> 01:11:21,506
(It feels a bit different.)

2045
01:11:22,006 --> 01:11:24,706
(Believe it or not, we're on great terms.)

2046
01:11:25,036 --> 01:11:26,976
(Just looking at their faces, I know if they are fake or real.)

2047
01:11:26,976 --> 01:11:28,276
(How do you know?)

2048
01:11:28,406 --> 01:11:29,546
(I just can tell.)

2049
01:11:29,676 --> 01:11:31,716
(This makes no sense.)

2050
01:11:31,716 --> 01:11:33,146
(You can't run a business like this.)

2051
01:11:33,616 --> 01:11:36,246
(What, did you come to film "Alley Restaurant?")

2052
01:11:36,646 --> 01:11:37,686
(Why offer solutions everywhere we go?)

2053
01:11:37,686 --> 01:11:39,056
(He's a guest.)

2054
01:11:39,616 --> 01:11:41,226
(I'm going to catch them all today.)

2055
01:11:41,526 --> 01:11:42,526
Our Ye Na.

2056
01:11:43,056 --> 01:11:45,696
(Everyone is so into "Catch Catch.")

2057
01:11:45,996 --> 01:11:48,066
(How is Ye Na's catching sense?)

2058
01:11:48,226 --> 01:11:49,596
(You have to go strictly by vibe, feeling, and intuition.)

2059
01:11:49,596 --> 01:11:50,836
(Catch, catch)

2060
01:11:52,066 --> 01:11:55,036
(To me, this place seems the fakest of all.)

2061
01:11:55,106 --> 01:11:56,806
(Can you just say things like that?)

2062
01:11:57,406 --> 01:11:59,836
(How will the chemistry between Ye Na and Jun Ha end?)
